Hey Andy,

I just wanted to give you an update.  I wasn't able to get an older version of the package to work, so I contacted the package maintainer. He believes the issue on your end, because the "Repository" isn't a documented field.  Based on his response, I don't expect any changes in the package, and thus won't be available until we can download it through R-forge.  For my purposes, I was able to use .png file instead and read it in with the PNG package.  This worked without any issues.

Thanks again for your help!
Josh

