Ameek,
I am not an expert on the R side, but my understanding is that the Rcpp v.0.11.0 update was pretty intrusive and requires a re-install of all the packages that rely on it.  If I were a betting man, I would bet that re-installing the various packages that you have in your app will fix the issue.

-Tareef

