The issue here might be that the shinyapps package attempts to detect your application dependencies by searching <https://github.com/rstudio/shinyapps/blob/master/R/dependencies.R#L101> for explicit library() or require() calls, which your code may not match. You can confirm if your application's dependencies are being detected by running:

shinyapps::appDependencies()

Can you paste the output of that command here?

-Andy

