Thanks for sharing Mark.  This is really nice to hear.  I am not sure if you are aware of the shiny-discuss discussion list <https://groups.google.com/forum/#!forum/shiny-discuss> where there may be a lot more people who could help give you ideas for how to get around Shiny's limitation and where our engineers who are focused on Shiny are constantly listening for opportunities to make Shiny easier to use.
As for the authentication restart comment, we totally hear you, and appreciate what you are trying to do.  Ideally adding and removing users should not touch any of the running containers.  We are just missing some of the needed capabilities within Shiny Server Pro to allow us to seamlessly add and remove users. Once that is in place, we will look at incorporating those capabilities within ShinyApps.

Best,

